			<zone xml:id="p2z6-0" points="1580,2073 1631,2071 1706,2021 1816,2056 1928,2007 1949,2012 1950,1925 1896,1942 1865,1933 1806,1962 1772,1937 1708,1955 1654,1923 1585,1923">1592,2013 1617,2012 1643,2010 1669,2008 1695,2006 1720,2005 1746,2004 1772,2004 1798,2002 1824,2001 1849,1999 1875,1998 1901,1998 1927,2001 1953,2004</zone>
